(7101713, 1082110, 101668, '<td valign="top">Yeah difficult one to crop properly. You wanted to show the double doors and then could not have cropped the drummer out. I think you did well with what you had</td>', 'Yeah difficult one to crop properly. You wanted to show the double doors and then could not have cropped the drummer out. I think you did well with what you had', '2013-09-11 07:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7101714, 1082601, 101668, '<td valign="top">This picture doesn''t do justice to the musicians'' appearance and neither the bright lights shining from behind. I would''ve cropped the ceiling out and if possible not have shot from this far below them. But hey, at least you tried, I don''t have an entry in this challenge because I couldn''t find any musicians. 5</td>', 'This picture doesn''t do justice to the musicians'' appearance and neither the bright lights shining from behind. I would''ve cropped the ceiling out and if possible not have shot from this far below them. But hey, at least you tried, I don''t have an entry in this challenge because I couldn''t find any musicians. 5', '2013-09-11 08:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7101716, 1082286, 101668, '<td valign="top">If I had entered it would have been something like this. Love it.</td>', 'If I had entered it would have been something like this. Love it.', '2013-09-11 08:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
